Z||000003||theogre||03-31-2001||10:34 PM||||Your running AOhell that should be your first clue right there. Rev6 is causing problems all over the place.<P>download and install IE 5.01 sp 2 or IE 5.5 sp1 directly from microsoft. Then install ALL the patches in Windows Update Critical Update section. If you are on a modem this is going to take at least several hours.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.microsoft.com/ie" TARGET=_blank>www.microsoft.com/ie</A> <P>Windowsupdate.microsoft.com if you don't have it on the start button.||||reg||1
